# Hublee Project Overview

Hublee is a cross-platform Flutter app for reading the Quran and Hadith. This is an Islamic religious text app -- the Quran is sacred scripture and must be displayed with absolute textual fidelity. See `quran-guidelines.mdc` and `hadith-guidelines.mdc` for Islamic display requirements.

## Tech Stack

- **Framework**: Flutter (Dart 3.10+), targets Android, iOS, Web, Windows, Linux, macOS
- **State management**: InheritedWidget (`AppScope`, `SettingsScope`, `BookmarkScope`) + ChangeNotifier (`SettingsController`, `BookmarkService`)
- **Navigation**: go_router with `StatefulShellRoute.indexedStack` for bottom navigation
- **Local storage**: `SharedPreferences` for settings, bookmarks, and last-read positions
- **UI**: Material Design 3, custom light/dark themes, NavigationBar (5 tabs)
- **Arabic rendering**: Custom `KFGQPCQuranicFontHafsSmart` font with Tajweed coloring
- **Animations**: `flutter_animate` for staggered list entry and card animations

## Architecture

- **Offline-first**: All Quran and Hadith data is bundled as JSON assets. No backend server, no database, no authentication, no runtime API calls.
- **Repository pattern**: `QuranChaptersRepository`, `QuranArabicRepository`, `QuranTranslationRepository`, `HadithRepository` load and parse JSON assets.
- **Service layer**: `ThemeModeService`, `SettingsController`, `BookmarkService`, `DailyContentService`, `QuranSearchService`, `HadithSearchService` handle business logic and persistence.
- **Router**: `lib/router.dart` defines all routes using go_router. Use the typed **`AppRoute`** API in `lib/router_paths.dart` for all navigation (e.g. `context.push(AppRoute.surah(id))`, `AppRoute.hadithBook(...)`). Do not hard-code path strings.
- **Design tokens**: `lib/theme/app_tokens.dart` — use `AppRadius`, `AppSpacing`, and `AppShadows` for consistent layout and shadows.
- **Pages**: `QuranPage` (surah list with Juz/Makki-Madani/Revelation tabs), `SurahReaderPage` (reading with scrubber + settings sheet), `HadithPage` (all books flat), `HadithReaderPage` (reading with scrubber + settings sheet), `SearchPage`, `BookmarksPage`, `SettingsPage`, `HomePage` (with Verse/Hadith of the Day)

## Key Directories

- `lib/router.dart` -- GoRouter config with StatefulShellRoute
- `lib/ui/app_shell.dart` -- Bottom navigation shell
- `lib/ui/` -- Pages and shared widgets
- `lib/ui/widgets/` -- Reusable widgets: `ArabicText`, `GradientTile`, `HubleeCard`, `SectionHeader`, `ReaderSettingsSheet`, `ScrollScrubber`, `tajweed.dart` (colour engine with `tajweedSpans()` and `tajweedColorAssignments()` testing API)
- `lib/router_paths.dart` -- Typed route paths (`AppRoute`); single source for all navigation URLs.
- `lib/quran/` -- Quran data models and repositories
- `lib/hadith/` -- Hadith data models and repository
- `lib/services/` -- Settings, theme, bookmarks, scopes, search models, daily content
- `lib/theme/` -- Light/dark theme config and Tajweed color extension
- `lib/data/` -- `AssetPaths` helper for asset file paths
- `assets/quran/` -- Arabic text JSON, surah metadata JSON, ClearQuran English translations
- `assets/hadith/` -- Hadith collection JSON files (forties, 9 books, others)
- `tools/` -- Build-time Dart scripts for fetching and processing data
- `test/tajweed_baqarah_test.dart` -- Unit tests for tajweed coloring (Surah Al-Baqarah 2:1-5). `test/router_paths_test.dart` -- Tests for `AppRoute` path building. `test/arabic_rendering_test.dart` -- Font coverage, layout/overflow guards, tajweed span integrity, and goldens. `test/settings_controller_test.dart` -- Zoom debounce. `test/quran_search_service_test.dart` -- Emlaey search corpus.
- `.github/workflows/ci.yml` -- CI: `dart format` check, `flutter analyze`, `flutter test --exclude-tags golden`. See `.cursor/rules/testing.mdc`.
- `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` -- Layer boundaries, navigation, tokens, and how to add pages or hadith collections.
- `.cursor/rules/coding-standards.mdc` -- Naming, commenting, and formatting rules
